{"steam_appid":764930,"steam_name":"Hubert","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/764930/392068498/15265960a488b6327be82c514b4204f6aacf0d86/1771849093/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1786984714","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257292041/f391781f36e42720600e93a8f51083536ba41746/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1786984714","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/d533d9c92de3132cf19ee14de5ef991c8b63eaf9/ss_d533d9c92de3132cf19ee14de5ef991c8b63eaf9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791983278","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/16b12de79c577085ffe3c8b2dc3dbcb89e3d9cb8/ss_16b12de79c577085ffe3c8b2dc3dbcb89e3d9cb8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791983278","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/03dd068e7fe0b197c2509a471564007ead90b8a7/ss_03dd068e7fe0b197c2509a471564007ead90b8a7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791983278","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/c057f8a850a7fbf988ea3cbc95c44d7c63d599e7/ss_c057f8a850a7fbf988ea3cbc95c44d7c63d599e7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791983278","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/1a11e0cc580a2b00053807773266be9816c2e7dc/ss_1a11e0cc580a2b00053807773266be9816c2e7dc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791983278"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of <i>Hubert</i>, a loyal shepherd navigating the uncharted northern wilderness. In this atmospheric third-person adventure, guide a scattered flock of sheep across gorgeous nature, braving harsh weather, treacherous terrain, and hidden dangers. <i>Hubert</i> blends immersive storytelling with a unique herding gameplay experience, all from the perspective of a devoted working dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A tale of friendship, bravery, and barking at sheep.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/0e6b09e99d741b11821a7918551c059e.poster.avif?t=1791983278\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/0e6b09e99d741b11821a7918551c059e.webm?t=1791983278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/0e6b09e99d741b11821a7918551c059e.mp4?t=1791983278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE DOG</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Hubert, a fluffy and overconfident dog with a nose for trouble. He sees the world through movement, scent, instinct, and curiosity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You experience the journey entirely from Hubert’s perspective, as a devoted working dog learning his place in a quiet world that slowly proves less predictable than it seems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/43818e8a6ec27248147c3e8ec5579023.poster.avif?t=1791983278\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/43818e8a6ec27248147c3e8ec5579023.webm?t=1791983278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/43818e8a6ec27248147c3e8ec5579023.mp4?t=1791983278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE BOND</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hubert is not alone. By his side is Lily, a sharp-witted kid who just convinced the grumpiest farmer in the valley to give them a job.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their relationship grows through shared routines, small moments, and quiet trust.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world around them changes, that bond is tested in subtle ways, shaping how Hubert sees the world and why he keeps going.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/ce6b15c9915897a3b74c91fd3a2bd33d.poster.avif?t=1791983278\" width=1024 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/ce6b15c9915897a3b74c91fd3a2bd33d.webm?t=1791983278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/ce6b15c9915897a3b74c91fd3a2bd33d.mp4?t=1791983278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HERD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their mission is to herd dozens of mildly chaotic sheep across pastures. Easy, right?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, not when the sheep have the attention span of a goldfish and the farmer has zero patience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Herding With Heart (and Fur):</strong> Commander Hubert is leading a battalion of sheep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story Full of Barks and Blunders:</strong> Navigate farm life, forge unlikely friendships, and try to stay on the farmer’s good side, or at least out of range of his angry voice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/721d939582583bc1ea6ee42e716b1ebf.poster.avif?t=1791983278\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/721d939582583bc1ea6ee42e716b1ebf.webm?t=1791983278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/721d939582583bc1ea6ee42e716b1ebf.mp4?t=1791983278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WILD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the fence line, the land grows quieter and stranger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is something in the woods?</strong> Something is out there. It is not just a threat, but a call Hubert understands in ways he cannot fully explain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brush-Painted Charm:</strong> Explore a countryside that feels warm and inviting on the surface, yet hides moments of unease, mystery, and the occasional howling at the moon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/8e7233da2eb44ec1e4ef9c822a28738e.poster.avif?t=1791983278\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/8e7233da2eb44ec1e4ef9c822a28738e.webm?t=1791983278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/8e7233da2eb44ec1e4ef9c822a28738e.mp4?t=1791983278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong>: This game contains mild mischief, stubborn sheep, and a dog who thinks he’s the main character (He might be right.)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras/872884fedd52db57750f6bdd7d57c2ed.avif?t=1791983278\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/764930/extras_big/872884fedd52db57750f6bdd7d57c2ed.avif?t=1791983278 width=800 height=587 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-14700KF<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Brocap Studio s.r.o."],"publishers":["Brocap Studio s.r.o."],"release_date":"Oct 14, 2026"}